[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3886559943","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115493#issuecomment-3886559943","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115493","id":3886559943,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7nqDLH","user":{"login":"LandonFerg","id":30322996,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzIyOTk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30322996?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LandonFerg","html_url":"https://github.com/LandonFerg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LandonFerg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LandonFerg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LandonFerg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LandonFerg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LandonFerg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LandonFerg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LandonFerg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LandonFerg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LandonFerg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-11T19:33:11Z","updated_at":"2026-02-11T19:33:11Z","body":"> * I am not sure if we need a dedicated property to toggle the center of mass' visibility. Personally, I would want it to always be visible, but only when the node is selected. See below.\r\n> * I think the center of mass gizmo should only display when the node is selected. This would better match most other gizmos to reduce visual clutter (see [godotengine/godot-proposals#6564](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/6564)).\r\n\r\nI originally had it this way (no property) but was unsure what would be ideal in the situation. Looking at it now I agree it should simply auto display when the node is selected and the property can be removed. I'll update this.\r\n\r\n> * The gizmo's color could change depending on whether the center mass is automatic or custom (e.g. automatic = orange, custom = magenta). The automatic center of mass may change according to underlying shape changes, while the custom center of mass stays in place, so it's important information to convey in the viewport.\r\n\r\nThis is a great idea! I will implement this into the PR.\r\n\r\n\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3886559943/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3906324088","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115493#issuecomment-3906324088","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115493","id":3906324088,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7o1cZ4","user":{"login":"LandonFerg","id":30322996,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzIyOTk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30322996?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LandonFerg","html_url":"https://github.com/LandonFerg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LandonFerg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LandonFerg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LandonFerg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LandonFerg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LandonFerg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LandonFerg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LandonFerg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LandonFerg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LandonFerg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-16T04:09:06Z","updated_at":"2026-02-16T04:09:06Z","body":"I removed the properties and hid the indicator if the node is not selected for RigidBody3D to reduce visual clutter like suggested. \r\n\r\n* To implement this in 2D (hiding the COM indicator on node deselect) I'd need to create is as an editor plugin, so I have it to always draw if `Engine::get_singleton()->is_editor_hint()`. Feel free to let me know if it does need to be its own editor plugin for 2D, but I think it works fine as is.\r\n\r\nI also implemented the color of the indicator to change according to auto vs. manual center of mass mode per suggestion from @Calinou \r\n\r\n<img width=\"1818\" height=\"1094\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0dac6769-9f76-4d8f-a950-a445e7501374\" />\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1798\" height=\"1118\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a300f646-b0b2-4890-ba4f-c01083831172\" />\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1945\" height=\"1038\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9b31df16-1fcd-4f29-b9bb-95858b9e2d34\" />\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3906324088/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5199167141","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115493#issuecomment-5199167141","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115493","id":5199167141,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABNeT-pQ","user":{"login":"jwheare","id":49224,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5MjI0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49224?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jwheare","html_url":"https://github.com/jwheare","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jwheare/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jwheare/